_id":"cbr-p000557","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"桓齮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000552","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0067","start":67,"end":72,"surface":"文信侯不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000530","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"舍人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000544","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000530","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000544","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m012-0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"舍人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:p021","text":"是歲也，秦始皇帝立九年矣。嫪毐亦為亂於秦，覺，夷其三族，而呂不韋廢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m021-0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"秦始皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004469","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m021-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004470","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m021-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"三族","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名角色或假設用稱保留，不補姓名、親屬或方案實施；母子血緣敘事仍待另存來源主張與學術覆核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m021-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004460","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen","book_id":"b-shiji-078","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-078-chunshen"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p010","text":"始皇帝益壯，太后淫不止。呂不韋恐覺禍及己，乃私求大陰人嫪毐以為舍人，時縱倡樂，使毐以其陰闕桐輪而行，令太后聞之，以啗太后。太后聞，果欲私得之。呂不韋乃進嫪毐，詐令人以腐罪告之。不韋又陰謂太后曰：「可事詐腐，則得給事中。」太后乃陰厚賜主腐者吏，詐論之，拔其須眉為宦者，遂得侍太后。太后私與通，絕愛之。有身，太后恐人知之，詐卜當避時，徙宮居雍。嫪毐常從，賞賜甚厚，事皆決於嫪毐。嫪毐家僮數千人，諸客求宦為嫪毐舍人千餘人。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"始皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004796","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"毐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0071","start":71,"end":74,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004790","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m010-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"嫪毐","kind":"person","p